---
// Terms.astro — Section #terms: Comprehensive & visually appealing Terms & Conditions grid
---

<section
    id="terms"
    class="pt-8 sm:pt-12 pb-16 sm:pb-24 bg-warm-nude/30 border-y border-warm-nude"
>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <!-- Section Header -->
        <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-12 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gold uppercase tracking-widest"
                >Ketentuan Pemesanan</span
            >
            <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-espresso">
                Syarat &amp; Ketentuan Layanan
            </h2>
            <p class="text-muted-brown text-sm sm:text-base">
                Panduan lengkap dan transparan mengenai tata cara pemesanan,
                fasilitas gratis, transportasi, dan pelaksanaan layanan makeup.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 6 Visual Cards Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <!-- Card 1: DP & Pembatalan -->
            <div
                class="luxury-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl space-y-4 border border-gold/25 flex flex-col justify-between"
            >
                <div class="space-y-3.5">
                    <div>
                        <span
                            class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-warm-nude text-espresso text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5"
                        >
                            Down Payment (DP)
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-espresso">
                            Ketentuan Pembayaran DP
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted-brown mt-1">
                            Konfirmasi jadwal &amp; penguncian tanggal acara
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <ul
                        class="text-xs text-espresso/90 space-y-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-warm-nude"
                    >
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Booking jadwal resmi wajib menyertakan <strong
                                    class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >DP sebesar 30%</strong
                                > dari total biaya.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation text-rose-500 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >DP bersifat <strong
                                    class="text-rose-700 font-semibold"
                                    >non-refundable (hangus)</strong
                                > apabila pesanan dibatalkan secara sepihak oleh klien.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Pelunasan sisa pembayaran dapat dilakukan pada
                                hari-H setelah sesi makeup selesai.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2: Fasilitas Gratis (Included) -->
            <div
                class="luxury-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl space-y-4 border border-gold/25 flex flex-col justify-between"
            >
                <div class="space-y-3.5">
                    <div>
                        <span
                            class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-warm-nude text-espresso text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5"
                        >
                            100% Free Included
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-espresso">
                            Fasilitas Gratis Setiap Paket
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted-brown mt-1">
                            Sudah termasuk tanpa ada biaya tersembunyi
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <ul
                        class="text-xs text-espresso/90 space-y-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-warm-nude"
                    >
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-gift text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                ><strong class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >GRATIS Pasang Bulu Mata</strong
                                > berkualitas tinggi, ringan, dan tidak mengganjal
                                di mata.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-gift text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                ><strong class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >GRATIS Simple Hijab Do / Hair Do</strong
                                > rapi &amp; elegan disesuaikan dengan tema busana.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Pemasangan aksesoris bawaan klien (jilbab,
                                mahkota, veil, atau ronce melati) tanpa biaya
                                jasa tambahan.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3: Area & Ongkir Transport -->
            <div
                class="luxury-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl space-y-4 border border-gold/25 flex flex-col justify-between"
            >
                <div class="space-y-3.5">
                    <div>
                        <span
                            class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-warm-nude text-espresso text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5"
                        >
                            Lokasi &amp; Transport
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-espresso">
                            Area &amp; Biaya Transportasi
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted-brown mt-1">
                            Ketentuan pengerjaan on-location (home service)
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <ul
                        class="text-xs text-espresso/90 space-y-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-warm-nude"
                    >
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-emerald-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                ><strong class="text-emerald-800 font-semibold"
                                    >Dalam Area Citra Raya (Maks. 3 km)</strong
                                >: Bebas biaya transportasi (<strong
                                    class="text-emerald-700">FREE Ongkir</strong
                                >).</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-route text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                ><strong class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >Luar Area Citra Raya</strong
                                >: Dikenakan ongkir hemat sebesar <strong
                                    class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >Rp 20.000 / 3 km</strong
                                > (kelipatan jarak).</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-calculator text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Simulasi hitung ongkir otomatis dapat dicek
                                langsung lewat tombol <strong
                                    class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >Kalkulator &amp; Booking</strong
                                > di menu atas.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 4: Softlens Add-on -->
            <div
                class="luxury-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl space-y-4 border border-gold/25 flex flex-col justify-between"
            >
                <div class="space-y-3.5">
                    <div>
                        <span
                            class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-warm-nude text-espresso text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5"
                        >
                            Add-on Opsional
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-espresso">
                            Softlens Add-on
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted-brown mt-1">
                            Pilihan lensa mata pelengkap riasan
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <ul
                        class="text-xs text-espresso/90 space-y-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-warm-nude"
                    >
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Pemesanan softlens baru higienis dikenakan
                                biaya tambahan mulai dari <strong
                                    class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >Rp 35.000 / pasang</strong
                                >.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-clock text-indigo-600 text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Wajib diajukan atau dikonfirmasikan <strong
                                    class="text-indigo-900 font-semibold"
                                    >minimal H-1 sebelum acara</strong
                                > untuk penyiapan ukuran minus/warna.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Klien dipersilakan membawa softlens pribadi
                                tanpa dikenakan biaya bantuan pasang.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 5: Kesiapan Hari H -->
            <div
                class="luxury-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl space-y-4 border border-gold/25 flex flex-col justify-between"
            >
                <div class="space-y-3.5">
                    <div>
                        <span
                            class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-warm-nude text-espresso text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5"
                        >
                            SOP Hari H
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-espresso">
                            Kesiapan Waktu &amp; Ruangan
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted-brown mt-1">
                            Kelancaran proses makeup agar selesai tepat waktu
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <ul
                        class="text-xs text-espresso/90 space-y-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-warm-nude"
                    >
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Klien diharapkan sudah <strong
                                    class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >mencuci wajah bersih</strong
                                > dan siap minimal <strong
                                    class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >15 menit sebelum</strong
                                > jam pengerjaan.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Mohon sediakan ruangan dengan <strong
                                    class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >pencahayaan yang baik</strong
                                > serta stopkontak listrik terdekat.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-half text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Estimasi waktu pengerjaan: 45 - 90 menit per
                                orang sesuai paket layanan yang diambil.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 6: Higienitas & Kualitas Produk -->
            <div
                class="luxury-card bg-white p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-3xl space-y-4 border border-gold/25 flex flex-col justify-between"
            >
                <div class="space-y-3.5">
                    <div>
                        <span
                            class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-warm-nude text-espresso text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5"
                        >
                            Steril &amp; Aman
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-espresso">
                            Higienitas &amp; Produk Terpercaya
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted-brown mt-1">
                            Keamanan dan kenyamanan kulit Anda prioritas kami
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <ul
                        class="text-xs text-espresso/90 space-y-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-warm-nude"
                    >
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-sparkles text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Seluruh kuas, beauty blender, dan aplikator
                                selalu <strong
                                    class="text-espresso font-semibold"
                                    >disterilkan &amp; dibersihkan</strong
                                > sebelum pengerjaan.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Menggunakan kosmetik original bermerek,
                                non-komedogenik, dan aman untuk kulit sensitif.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                            <i
                                class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-gold text-xs mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            ></i>
                            <span
                                >Hasil makeup tahan lama, anti-crack, dan nyaman
                                dipakai berjam-jam selama acara berlangsung.</span
                            >
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
